### Get all users
GET http://localhost:4000/api/users

### Create user
POST http://localhost:4000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Vinko",
  "email": "vinko@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Create health metric
POST http://localhost:4000/api/metrics
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "type": "weight",
  "value": 78
}

### Get metrics by user
GET http://localhost:4000/api/metrics/1

### Create goal
POST http://localhost:4000/api/goals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "description": "Bajar de peso",
  "targetValue": 70
}

### Create workout
POST http://localhost:4000/api/workouts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "duration": 45,
  "caloriesBurned": 500
}

### Create meal
POST http://localhost:4000/api/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "description": "Ensalada",
  "calories": 300
}
